---
# Open WebUI Networking Configuration
## Configures network connectivity for the Open WebUI container via a systemd-container drop-in file.
## This allows the server maintainer to isolate or connect the container to
## specific networks (like 'ai-network') without modifying the primary container definition.

variant: fcos
version: 1.6.0

storage:
  files:
    - path: /etc/containers/systemd/open-webui/open-webui.container.d/networking.conf
      overwrite: true
      contents:
        inline: |
          [Container]
          # Assign the container to the dedicated AI network for secure inter-service communication
          Network=ai-network
      user:
        name: root
      group:
        name: root
      mode: 0644
